que.","exJa":"薬局は銀行の隣です。","exEn":"The pharmacy is next to the bank.","id":"lex:PRE:à côté de"},"lex:PRE:en face de":{"fr":"en face de","pos":"PRE","posJa":"前置詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜の向かいに","en":"opposite","gram":"前置詞句","constr":"-","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Le café est en face de l'hôtel.","exJa":"カフェはホテルの向かいです。","exEn":"The café is opposite the hotel.","id":"lex:PRE:en face de"},"lex:PRE:à cause de":{"fr":"à cause de","pos":"PRE","posJa":"前置詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜のせいで","en":"because of","gram":"前置詞句","constr":"悪い結果に使う（よい結果は grâce à）","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Je suis en retard à cause du trafic.","exJa":"渋滞のせいで遅れました。","exEn":"I'm late because of the traffic.","id":"lex:PRE:à cause de"},"lex:PRE:grâce à":{"fr":"grâce à","pos":"PRE","posJa":"前置詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜のおかげで","en":"thanks to","gram":"前置詞句","constr":"よい結果に使う","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Grâce à toi, j'ai réussi.","exJa":"君のおかげでうまくいった。","exEn":"Thanks to you, I succeeded.","id":"lex:PRE:grâce à"},"lex:PRO:quoi":{"fr":"quoi","pos":"PRO","posJa":"代名詞","level":"A1","ja":"何","en":"what","gram":"疑問代名詞","constr":"C'est quoi ?／à quoi ?（口語）","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Tu fais quoi ce soir ?","exJa":"今晩は何をするの。","exEn":"What are you doing tonight?","id":"lex:PRO:quoi"},"lex:PRO:se":{"fr":"se","pos":"PRO","posJa":"代名詞","level":"A1","ja":"自分を、自分に","en":"oneself","gram":"再帰代名詞","constr":"se + 動詞（代名動詞をつくる）","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Il se lève à six heures.","exJa":"彼は六時に起きます。","exEn":"He gets up at six.","id":"lex:PRO:se"},"lex:PRO:rien":{"fr":"rien","pos":"PRO","posJa":"代名詞","level":"A1","ja":"何も〜ない","en":"nothing","gram":"不定代名詞","constr":"ne ... rien／de rien（どういたしまして）","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Je n'ai rien compris.","exJa":"何も分かりませんでした。","exEn":"I didn't understand anything.","id":"lex:PRO:rien"},"lex:PRO:je":{"fr":"je","pos":"PRO","posJa":"代名詞","level":"A1","ja":"私は","en":"I","gram":"主語人称代名詞","constr":"母音の前は j'","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Je suis technicien.","exJa":"私は技術者です。","exEn":"I am a technician.","gFr":"Je travaille dans une banque.","gJa":"私は銀行