:"A1","ja":"いくつもの","en":"several","gram":"不定形容詞","constr":"男女同形・複数のみ","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Plusieurs personnes sont absentes.","exJa":"何人か欠席しています。","exEn":"Several people are absent.","id":"lex:DET:plusieurs"},"lex:CONJ:et":{"fr":"et","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"そして、と","en":"and","gram":"等位接続詞","constr":"-","situ":"機能語","exFr":"J'ai acheté du pain et du fromage.","exJa":"パンとチーズを買いました。","exEn":"I bought bread and cheese.","id":"lex:CONJ:et"},"lex:CONJ:ou":{"fr":"ou","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"または","en":"or","gram":"等位接続詞","constr":"※où（どこ）と混同しない","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Thé ou café ?","exJa":"紅茶それともコーヒー。","exEn":"Tea or coffee?","id":"lex:CONJ:ou"},"lex:CONJ:mais":{"fr":"mais","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"しかし","en":"but","gram":"等位接続詞","constr":"-","situ":"機能語","exFr":"C'est cher, mais c'est bon.","exJa":"高いけどおいしいです。","exEn":"It's expensive, but it's good.","id":"lex:CONJ:mais"},"lex:CONJ:donc":{"fr":"donc","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"だから","en":"so, therefore","gram":"等位接続詞","constr":"-","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Il pleut, donc je prends le bus.","exJa":"雨だからバスに乗ります。","exEn":"It's raining, so I'm taking the bus.","id":"lex:CONJ:donc"},"lex:CONJ:car":{"fr":"car","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"というのは","en":"for, because","gram":"等位接続詞","constr":"文頭には置けない","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Je rentre, car je suis fatigué.","exJa":"疲れたので帰ります。","exEn":"I'm going home, for I'm tired.","id":"lex:CONJ:car"},"lex:CONJ:parce que":{"fr":"parce que","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜だから","en":"because","gram":"従属接続詞＋直説法","constr":"pourquoi への答え","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Je suis en retard parce que le train a été annulé.","exJa":"電車が運休したので遅れました。","exEn":"I'm late because the train was cancelled.","id":"lex:CONJ:parce que"},"lex:CONJ:que":{"fr":"que","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜ということ","en":"that","gram":"従属接続詞","constr":"dire que, penser que など／母音の前は qu'","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Je pense que c'est une bonne idée.","exJa":"いい考えだと思います。","exEn":"I think that it's a good idea.","id":"lex:CONJ:que"},"lex:CONJ:quand":{"fr":"quand","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜のとき","en":"when","gram":"従属接続詞＋直説法","constr":"未来の話でも従属節は未来形","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Quand j'aurai fini, je t'appellerai.","exJa":"終わったら電話します。","exEn":"When I've finished, I'll call you.","id":"lex:CONJ:quand"},"lex:CONJ:si":{"fr":"si","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"もし〜なら","en":"if","gram":"従属接続詞","constr":"si + 現在形 → 主節は未来形","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Si tu veux, on peut y aller ensemble.","exJa":"よかったら一緒に行けます。","exEn":"If you want, we can go together.","id":"lex:CONJ:si"},"lex:CONJ:comme":{"fr":"comme","pos":"CONJ","posJa":"接続詞","level":"A1","ja":"〜のように、〜なので","en":"as, like, since","gram":"従属接続詞","constr":"文頭では理由を表す","situ":"機能語","exFr":"Comme il pleut, on reste ici.","exJa":"雨なのでここにいます。","exEn":"As it's raining, we'll stay here.","id":"lex:CONJ:comme"}}